      "string_id": "hitruga_reward_2_dialog_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "You sure about that, pal? Be serious now, do I look like a rookie?",
      "JA_current": "You sure about that, pal? Be serious now, do I look like a rookie?",
      "JA_new": "本当に？　冗談はよせよ。俺が新米に見えるか？",
